# Generated by Next on every build, and rewritten with CRLF endings on Windows.
# Linting it reported five "Delete ␍" errors against a file nobody edits and
# that `npm run lint` then could not fix -- `npm run lint -- --fix` corrects it
# and the next build puts the carriage returns back.
